For stochastic validation of the new rating law, exact finite enumeration is primary and has zero numerical uncertainty. Distribution checks report multinomial sampling uncertainty, not equality of random sample proportions to expectations. For complete longitudinal burden targets propose precision binding `BURDEN-PRECISION-01` 1.0: mean-score absolute MCSE <=0.01 score unit; each defined-assessment probability and each conditional category probability absolute MCSE <=0.001 probability unit; additionally every component <=0.1 of its own actual matched comparator SE. These are synthetic numerical tolerances, not clinical meaningful differences. Reuse the accepted 10,000-draw outer batches, maximum1,000 batches and conditional integration budgets/refinements, with each component's epsilon the stricter absolute/relative tolerance. Retain covariance and ratio denominators. Undefined structural denominator is undefined, zero sampled denominator is unresolved; neither passes as zero.

For the matched burden comparator pilot, use1,000 independent balanced randomized trials at each actual matched catalog n (60/240 where declared); conditional H uses60 independently filtered environments,30 per arm, with the independently regenerated per-environment filter/selection/continuation construction specified in ESTINT-PRECISION-01 R1. Every environment supplies one assigned continuation, its defined-assessment indicator and its B when defined. Keep all environments, including death/undefined outcomes. For each arm, probability of defined assessment has plug-in Bernoulli-mean SE on full n_arm; conditional category and conditional mean estimators use that arm's actual defined count m, with respective Bernoulli sample variance/m and score sample variance/m. m<2 is undefined SE. Keep ratios and own-arm populations; no survivor matching. As a deliberately conservative first binding, use the original accepted G1 per-trial-minimum rule: minimum of every required realized nonnegative component SE and positive RMS-SE lower limits (RMS minus1.645 delta-method MCSE), with any zero/nonpositive/undefined minimum requiring independently derived analytic truth or unresolved status. Do not borrow EST-INT's rare-event pilot exception automatically for conditional rating ratios. Thus rare/degenerate categories can remain unresolved at the compute cap; no floor or retry-until-pass. This executable failure outcome is intentional, not an omitted algorithm. A future less conservative matched-ratio precision method would need a separate proposal.

At conditional numerical refinements, pilot score/category/defined-indicator means and component SE bindings must stabilize through both successive accepted particle transitions at the final epsilon: absolute mean change plus1.96 paired MCSE <=epsilon/4; 0.1 times absolute binding change <=epsilon/4. Retain the original quadrature/particle/within-filter/between-filter truth budgets and total MCSE gate. Independent filters are required per pilot environment, not merely per trial. These additional checks do not relax accepted EST-INT precision, likelihood or original truth obligations. Conditional integration must include observed threshold inequalities; deterministic review and link records have no duplicate independent likelihood factor.
